Bush (@kamalie-bush: 0, #part-of @kamalie-fracture) {
A passive cluster of weaker green parts. It can be picked up, carried, released and used through physical contact. Central impacts split nearby clumps; edge impacts mostly remove the struck region and scatter it farther.

The custom extension below is authored definition data. The first implementation consumes its matching materials.json snapshot; live Record loading is future work.
}

Extension @kamalie-bush "kamalie.material" {
    revision 1
    id "bush"
    responsive false
    integrity 2.6
    impact_transfer 0.009
    wear 0.12
    part_size 2.5
    color [0.29 0.39 0.15]
    spawn_weight 5
}
